                                                "sense_id": "3fd52e5f-a7d2-3ac3-a645-75dbd96706ed",
                                                "text": "There’s a good chance you’ve heard of the Ninja Creami by now. The original version of the ice cream maker has been around since 2021, but thanks to TikTok, it’s been one of the buzziest kitchen appliances lately."
                                            }
